   Sorry for the self promotion, but you may find our recent paper useful. http://journals.plos.org/plosone/article?id=10.1371/journal.pone.0134880

  There we published several R/qtl based scripts and functions for genetic map curation with a 4way/BC maps. Although we used other strategies for linkage group formation and ordering, we had the same problem: huge LG of with more than 1,000 cM. Using the strategies described there we were able to reduce the size to the expected 100 cM. I hope that may help you to solve your problem!

