I am in need to convert my data, who are in physical format for Genetic format (cM).
How do I do that?

Thank you.

From u04e62c3b36bb17bf at groups.google.com  Tue Aug 18 18:39:24 2015
From: u04e62c3b36bb17bf at groups.google.com (John Lovell)
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2015 18:39:24 +0000
Subject: Re: How to convert physical position in position genetics?
Message-ID: <uwyuiBpsw_Q.rDwIQlmQCAAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <uwyuiBpsw_Q.NjDF4N0oDAAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
References: <uwyuiBpsw_Q.NjDF4N0oDAAJ@rqtl-disc.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/rqtl-disc/c/uwyuiBpsw_Q/m/rDwIQlmQCAAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
